    "text": "<p>Match List - I with List - II.</p><table border=\"1\" cellpadding=\"1\" cellspacing=\"1\" style=\"width: 500px;\">\t<tbody>\t\t<tr>\t\t\t<td>&nbsp;</td>\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align: center;\"><strong>List-I</strong></td>\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align: center;\">&nbsp;</td>\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align: center;\"><strong>List-II</strong></td>\t\t</tr>\t\t<tr>\t\t\t<td>(A)</td>\t\t\t<td>AC generator</td>\t\t\t<td>(I)</td>\t\t\t<td>Detects the presence of current in the circuit</td>\t\t</tr>\t\t<tr>\t\t\t<td>(B)</td>\t\t\t<td>Galvanometer</td>\t\t\t<td>(II)</td>\t\t\t<td>Converts mechanical energy into electrical energy</td>\t\t</tr>\t\t<tr>\t\t\t<td>(C)</td>\t\t\t<td>Transformer</td>\t\t\t<td>(III)</td>\t\t\t<td>Works on the principle of resonance in AC circuit</td>\t\t</tr>\t\t<tr>\t\t\t<td>(D)</td>\t\t\t<td>Metal detector</td>\t\t\t<td>(IV)</td>\t\t\t<td>Changes an alternating voltage for smaller or greater value</td>\t\t</tr>\t</tbody></table>",
